Subject: [PATCH 229/395] arm64: dts: renesas: r9a09g047: Add WDT1-WDT3 nodes

commit 146a9b058ec780581f580b0de9bbc0264b59d701 upstream.

Add WDT1-WDT3 nodes to RZ/G3E ("R9A09G047") SoC DTSI.

